        <header class="cs-head" data-reveal>
          <p class="eyebrow">02 · Real-World Post-Mortem</p>
          <h2>Debugging a -33.8% drawdown into a v7.2 architecture</h2>
          <p>
            Instead of burying early live-account losses, the live trade journal was audited to isolate structural failure modes
            and convert every human and model discipline failure into a hard code-level invariant.
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="cs-pm">
          <article class="cs-pm__card cs-pm__card--fail" data-reveal>
            <span class="cs-pm__tag">Observed Failure · v1 Live Journal</span>
            <h3>Three compounding governance failures</h3>
            <p class="sub">Post-mortem diagnosis from live execution logs pinpointed why early iterations broke down under volatility:</p>
            <ul class="pts">
              <li><strong>100% semiconductor concentration</strong> turned correlated sector drawdowns into portfolio-level impairment.</li>
              <li><strong>Discretionary "Hold to Green" overrides</strong> defeated pre-defined stop-losses whenever losing trades triggered loss aversion.</li>
              <li><strong>Trading against a RISK-OFF regime</strong> repeatedly entered long swing setups while broad indices broke below trend and volatility spiked.</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="cs-pm__stat">
              <strong>-33.8%</strong>
              <span>Live drawdown that triggered the ground-up architecture redesign</span>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="cs-pm__card cs-pm__card--fix" data-reveal>
            <span class="cs-pm__tag">Engineering Remediation · v1 → v7.2</span>
            <h3>Programmatic guardrails replacing willpower</h3>
            <p class="sub">Every root cause was mapped to a deterministic enforcement boundary that neither the human operator nor the LLM can quietly bypass:</p>
            <ul class="pts">
              <li><strong>Decoupled reasoning from math:</strong> LLM subagents handle qualitative research; deterministic Python computes sizing, regime state, and cap checks.</li>
              <li><strong>Hard sector &amp; semiconductor caps</strong> plus cash and fractional-share floors enforced before recommendation emission.</li>
              <li><strong>Banned entries in the noisy first 30 minutes (09:30–10:00 ET)</strong> to filter opening auction whipsaws.</li>
              <li><strong>Tier-1 IAA evidence standard</strong> (Identity, Authority, Accountability) required on catalyst claims.</li>
              <li><strong><code>PreToolUse</code> policy-guard hook</strong> programmatically blocks AI tool calls from editing immutable <code>RULES.md</code>.</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="cs-pm__stat">
              <strong>v7.2</strong>
              <span>Hard-gated release verified by 20 pytest suites &amp; 46/46 E2E checks</span>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

